      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "本当にここであっています？\nただの小川に何か特別なものがあるんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "339d13d982f8e928aa0184891a6df45f1ff245fffeaddcf5053c1ce7ffdde8c9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "정말 여기가 맞나요?\n평범한 개울에 뭔가 특별한 게 있나요?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 6,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b012-20261109-same-model-pass2-aaabc0ee",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "99c8e6bd61ce9d180cd000fe4d6c0faf9b914d0823bde0406c580097ab763818:000002_3464324865711828754:g0:r5",
      "row_index_0based": 5,
      "serialized_row_index": 5,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アイレン",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "本当にここであっています？\nただの小川に何か特別なものがあるんですか？",
